    "name": "Wuxia Saga: Ten Thousand Paths",
    "steam_appid": 2727360,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Update</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/3ca461e313c28a755eb70246838b6bc2.avif?t=1754617383\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>April Update:</strong> Introduced the Sect System, allowing players to freely join any sect. Each sect offers a unique progression path and martial arts system, providing a distinct and immersive  experience.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a vibrant Wuxia world where your choices shape your fate. Will you rise as a noble hero, a wandering swordsman, or a master of shadows? With countless story branches, unique character origins, and a reactive open world, no two journeys are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge alliances with legendary heroes, join powerful sects, and master hundreds of combat techniques. Every decision matters. Every encounter leaves a mark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a story you play, it\u2019s <strong>Jianghu</strong>, a martial arts world that remembers you. <br>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/49524532f1ae301d3caae1b0fb1b0811.avif?t=1754617383\" data-has-big width=800 height=256 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Be Anyone</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your journey from one of dozens of unique life paths, each with its own storyline, character growth, and worldview. Whether you rise from a noble house or survive as a wandering beggar, your origin shapes your destiny\u2014and how the world sees you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/ee2de9044fe39cc228c391fa133eeb11.poster.avif?t=1754617383\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/ee2de9044fe39cc228c391fa133eeb11.webm?t=1754617383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/ee2de9044fe39cc228c391fa133eeb11.mp4?t=1754617383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Dynamic, Branching Narrative</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring a branching, multi-line plot akin to galgames, the story evolves in markedly different directions based on player choices. If players choose not to intervene, the plot develops organically in a completely authentic martial arts world.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Open-World Martial Arts Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander a vast and ever-changing Jianghu filled with spontaneous events, hidden secrets, random encounters, and evolving storylines. No two journeys are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/6af90e65b7c2bb7c4877528d7c468615.poster.avif?t=1754617383\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/6af90e65b7c2bb7c4877528d7c468615.webm?t=1754617383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/6af90e65b7c2bb7c4877528d7c468615.mp4?t=1754617383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Forge Bonds with Like-Minded Companions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roaming the martial arts world should never be a solitary journey. Heroes, legends, and confidantes await, just a chance encounter away. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple Ways to Complete Missions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle missions your way: overpower with brute force, execute with clever finesse, or even unravel the underlying intricacies to unexpectedly resolve events.. Every challenge can be approached in different ways, rewarding creativity and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/b1b04463845f7df44390a35449c5bf2d.poster.avif?t=1754617383\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/b1b04463845f7df44390a35449c5bf2d.webm?t=1754617383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/b1b04463845f7df44390a35449c5bf2d.mp4?t=1754617383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join Various Sects</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pledge yourself to one of many martial sects, each with their own philosophy, martial arts techniques, and secret traditions. Train, rise through the ranks, and shape their future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/f17fafba78e2ed30b8aa138268bdc896.poster.avif?t=1754617383\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/f17fafba78e2ed30b8aa138268bdc896.webm?t=1754617383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/f17fafba78e2ed30b8aa138268bdc896.mp4?t=1754617383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master Hundreds of Martial Arts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your ideal fighter with nine schools and hundreds of unique techniques, including blades, swords, fingers, fists, spears, inner mystical power, and more. Mix and match to craft a style that is unique to your own. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deep Combat System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle in a deeply tactical system inspired by classic martial arts tales. Terrain, weather, positioning, and abilities all factor into victory. Outsmart your enemies as much as you overpower them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/2af3b9439cea2587ebe303fc91f2f945.poster.avif?t=1754617383\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/2af3b9439cea2587ebe303fc91f2f945.webm?t=1754617383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/2af3b9439cea2587ebe303fc91f2f945.mp4?t=1754617383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Infinite Replayability</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every playthrough offers something new. With a wealth of story branches, character builds, random events, unlockables, and world dynamics, no two adventures are ever the same!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/afad8d2a9448ce763fe90da45bd6fd8c.poster.avif?t=1754617383\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/afad8d2a9448ce763fe90da45bd6fd8c.webm?t=1754617383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/afad8d2a9448ce763fe90da45bd6fd8c.mp4?t=1754617383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
