akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/2af3b9439cea2587ebe303fc91f2f945.poster.avif?t=1754617383\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/2af3b9439cea2587ebe303fc91f2f945.webm?t=1754617383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/2af3b9439cea2587ebe303fc91f2f945.mp4?t=1754617383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Infinite Replayability</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every playthrough offers something new. With a wealth of story branches, character builds, random events, unlockables, and world dynamics, no two adventures are ever the same!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/afad8d2a9448ce763fe90da45bd6fd8c.poster.avif?t=1754617383\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/afad8d2a9448ce763fe90da45bd6fd8c.webm?t=1754617383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727360/extras/afad8d2a9448ce763fe90da45bd6fd8c.mp4?t=1754617383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
